  "description": "The day Se-Ul declares that she will stay single, three attractive men suddenly decide to pop into her life all at once. A man who matches her ideal type, a childhood friend she’s known for twenty years, and a man who checks off all the right boxes. Will Se-Ul be able to hold firm to her declaration of staying single? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
